  "content": {
    "title": "Will I get mail on Good Friday? USPS, UPS and FedEx delivery schedules on Easter weekend",
    "text": "You won't be getting mail on Easter -Credit:Tony Anderson via Getty Images (Tony Anderson via Getty Images)Christians across the globe are preparing for their faith's most important celebration, finalizing plans to commemorate Jesus' resurrection.Good Friday occurs on Friday, April 3, and Easter lands on Sunday, April 5, bringing the Lenten period to a close. In the days leading up to this sacred event, Christians will observe Holy Thursday, Good Friday and Holy Saturday, reflecting on Christ's death on the cross.Following this, families and friends will gather to celebrate the resurrection through spring gatherings and celebrations, Easter egg hunts, and a variety of other traditions. For anyone thinking about last-minute runs for vital party essentials, it's important to remember deliveries may experience delays on Easter.• 1 'underlying issue' caused Miss Thailand's veneers to fall out on stage, dentist says• 3 US stocks Americans should buy now as war in Iran enters second monthThe post office will be open on Good Friday -Credit:GettyWill I get mail on Good Friday? Will I get mail on Easter?The post office will operate on Good Friday, and Americans should anticipate receiving their mail. Easter, though, falls on a Sunday, meaning the U.S. Postal Service will not be delivering mail.Is UPS open on Good Friday? Is UPS open on Easter?UPS pickup and delivery services will operate on Good Friday. The UPS Store locations will likewise be open to serve customers on Good Friday.There will be no UPS pickup or delivery service on Easter Sunday, though. The UPS Store locations may be closed, but it's advisable to confirm with your neighborhood store for exact operating hours.UPS Express Critical service (operated by Marken) is accessible every day of the year. Call 1-800-714-8779 or visit marken.com.UPS pickup and delivery services will operate on Good Friday -Credit:Trevor Srednick via Getty ImagesIs FedEx open on Good Friday? Is FedEx open on Easter?FedEx and FedEx Freight will operate with adjusted hours on Good Friday, while FedEx offices, FedEx Custom Critical, and FedEx Logistics will remain open.On Saturday, FedEx Freight will be closed while all other FedEx services will continue operating.On Easter Sunday, FedEx and FedEx Freight will be closed. FedEx offices will run with adjusted hours. FedEx Custom Critical and FedEx Logistics will remain open.",
